# UX wireframe-first

Do not design destination UI. No decorative gradients, shadows, custom animations, or heavy CSS.

Tailwind only: grid/flex layout, `border`, spacing `p-4`/`gap-4`, and `:focus-visible`.

One decision per step (progressive disclosure). Plain-language microcopy. Poka-yoke: block illegal leave combinations and explain why (e.g. first 14 weeks are mother-only).

Headless UX: keep step, validation, state, and copy logic in `useParentPlan` and `useGuidedChat`.
